/**
 * eruda-network-plus v2.1.0
 * Enhanced Network panel for eruda, inspired by ProxyPin & Chrome DevTools.
 *
 * Usage:
 *   <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/eruda"></script>
 *   <script src="eruda-network-plus.js"></script>
 *   <script>
 *     eruda.init()
 *     eruda.remove('network')            // remove the built-in network tool
 *     eruda.add(new erudaNetworkPlus())  // mount the enhanced one
 *   </script>
 *
 * Features:
 *  - Chrome DevTools style UI: toolbar, type filter chips, overview timeline,
 *    waterfall column, sortable columns, bottom status bar
 *  - Bilingual UI (English / 中文), follows system language by default,
 *    switchable with one tap, persisted in localStorage
 *  - Capture: XHR + fetch, initiator (source file:line) detection
 *  - Stats bar: requests / transferred / finish / failed, failed filter
 *  - Detail view: Headers / Payload / Preview / Response / Initiator / Timing
 *    with 7-segment timing waterfall, JSON tree preview, image preview
 *  - Replay, Copy as cURL, Copy as fetch, Copy response
 *  - HAR 1.2 export & import
 *  - ProxyPin inspired tools: URL blocklist (simulated 403), URL rewrite /
 *    redirect rules, Mock response (custom status / body / content type)
 *  - Network throttling: Slow 3G / Fast 3G / Offline (fetch shaped, XHR latency)
 *
 * MIT License
 */
